{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26205","headline":"上巳日赠都上人 一 · 殷尧藩","name":"上巳日赠都上人 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三月初三日，千家与万家。\n蝶飞秦地草，莺入汉宫花。\n鞍马皆争丽，笙歌尽鬬奢。\n吾师无所愿，惟愿老烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}